WEBVTT

00:02:58.704 --> 00:03:03.954
have known and loved someone
with Alzheimer's.

00:03:05.288 --> 00:03:06.913
I am no exception.

00:03:08.163 --> 00:03:11.621
One day when I was four,

00:03:11.621 --> 00:03:13.704
I went out with my grandmother.

00:03:14.496 --> 00:03:17.329
And when I looked up to her to say,

00:03:17.329 --> 00:03:19.371
"Let's go home,"

00:03:19.371 --> 00:03:22.538
She said, "Home.

00:03:22.538 --> 00:03:23.913
Where is home?"

00:03:27.454 --> 00:03:31.413
So to see if we could treat
Alzheimer's disease